Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:12.39,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.91,0:31:35.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（去你妈的）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's okay. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下 快扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down. Drop it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是史蒂文·爱德华兹医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Steven Edwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是道恩·勒纳警官 你感觉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Officer Dawn Lerner. How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.85,0:00:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚特兰大的格拉迪纪念医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady Memorial Hospital in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么到这里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的警官在路边发现了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My officers found you on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一群行尸围住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by rotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手腕骨折了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wrist was fractured.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,头部受了轻伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you sustained a superficial head wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能记得你的名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.79,0:01:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起的那个男人 他也在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man I was with, is he here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.03,0:01:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们没有救你 你也会成为行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we hadn't saved you, you'd be one of them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你欠我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周前 有些人出去找补给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of them out there were on a run about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在卡车停靠站\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found two boxes of Bisquick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了两盒饼干粉和一盒梅尔·哈格德的磁带\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Merle Haggard tape at a truck stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.11,0:02:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在桥下发现了这位先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then this gentleman under a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,心搏停止 极度脱水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cardiac arrest and extreme dehydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to do what I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 就这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果病人没有好转的迹象…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If patients don't show any signs of improvement…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩就会下命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dawn calls it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 尸体要冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, body's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人住在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚够让我们运转下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enough to keep us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人一开始就在这里 有些人作为病人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us started here, some came as patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能埋了他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we bury him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 有必要时我们才出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we only go out when we need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能不是最庄严的尸体处理系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not be the most dignified disposal system,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们只能凑合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we work with what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功保卫了楼梯井\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've managed to secure and guard the stairwells,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一楼的窗户碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the windows are blown out on the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸们听到声音 就会进地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotters find their way into the basement when they hear a noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果尸体足够温暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the bodies are warm or warm enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会吃掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}they clean up some of the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用一切可以用的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use everything you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.09,0:04:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这是最快下去的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus it's the fastest way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你气色越来越好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我们有了一些枪支的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a lead on some guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我和搭档去了很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}so me and my partner were pretty far out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候我们看见了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when we saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路上爬着\N{\fnArial\fs30}wriggling in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得我了啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟一只行尸搏斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fighting a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一切都变黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then everything went black.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出现时 有一只在盯着你的大腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one was eyeing your thighs when we showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我先赶到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉了那只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacked that rotter up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是戈尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人帮了你的忙时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When someone does you a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,表示感谢是一种礼节\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a courtesy to show some appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想让我写下你占用的一切资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want me to write down everything you're taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都有所代价 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything costs something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 你要洗衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, you've got laundry duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我想要我的警服…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want my uniform washed …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开清洗 并且熨平\N{\fnArial\fs30}separately and pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前感觉就像溺在研究的海洋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to feel like I was drowning in research.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这海洋枯竭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the oceans are dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能在无聊中窒息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm suffocating in boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你都安逸到无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you feel safe enough to be bored,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小金伯朗的歌 喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Junior Kimbrough. Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都想不起上一次听唱片是什么时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember the last time I heard a record.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是身为这里唯一的医生的少数好处之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the few perks I get for being the only doctor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那个好处 还有这盘东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and whatever this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小白鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃的那份呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿的越多 欠的越多 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I take, the more I owe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃过小白鼠吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever tried guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃过就不会管这叫好处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't call it a perk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用告诉道恩 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn doesn't have to know. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘鲁人喜欢吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good enough for Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是卡拉瓦乔的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Caravaggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在高级艺术博物馆外的街道上捡到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it on the street outside the High.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,像垃圾一样丢在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它现在没有容身之所了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have a place anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,艺术的宗旨并非生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Art isn't about survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是超越\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about transcendence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越动物本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being more than animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,崛起立于高处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rising above.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再那样了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do that anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在还在唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又有新的伤员 - 找到了他的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got a new one. - Found his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫加文·崔维特\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Gavin Trevitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一楼的公寓摔下来 试图逃开几只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fell from a first floor apartment trying to get away from some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失了很多血 生命迹象在衰竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lost a lot of blood and his vitals are dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他活不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经给他太多汽油了… - 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've already given him gas… - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你想救人 那就救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to save people, so save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道他的伤有多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know the extent of his injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看 他已经不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this one's a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你不想让我浪费资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you didn't want me wasting resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我想让你试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, today I want you to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给心电图和超声波插上电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, plug the EKG and the ultrasound into that battery pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 很好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Good. Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,接在病人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now attach it to the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,张力性气胸 要穿肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tension pneumothorax. Punctured lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 给我从那柜子里拿一个空心针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, I need a large hollow needle in that cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,能救活吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从楼上摔了下来 道恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell from a building, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,能救活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he going to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见这些淤青了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see these bruises?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是内出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has internal bleeding,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要分层扫描才能知道有多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need a CAT scan to know how bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我知道了出血程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if I could determine that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有能救他的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the tools to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你了 这是浪费资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, this was a waste of resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文 给我搞清楚局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve, try to grasp the stakes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她总是这样吗 - 只有心情不好的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she always like that? - Only on her bad days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 她心情永远不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unfortunate for us that's the only kind she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚给你留了件新衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah left you a new shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}She likes things neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她肯定喜欢你的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must love your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都以不同的方式为她效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have ways of making her pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在门外等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait for you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩叫你 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn needs you, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我们发现了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lucky we found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你想做什么 都不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you were thinking, it wasn't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you have two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么我们帮你截肢 要么你自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either we cut off your arm or you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 还有你的小婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you and your little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 自以为是的荡妇 - 戈尔曼 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smart-ass whore. - Gorman, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是麻醉剂 你用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's anesthetic. You need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死吧 - 她已经做出选择了 快动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go to hell. - She made her choice. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! I said leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不会见死不救\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会眼睁睁地看你尸变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not going to let you turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我帮不上忙 - 你想让她死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't help. - Do you want her to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 帮我们压住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, I need you to hold her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 没事的 - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. It's okay. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会回他那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going back to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你控制不了他们 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't control them. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「棒棒糖协会」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the Lollipop Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得上午的事过后 你可以吃点糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured you could use a pick-me-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,换换心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}after this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道我就把整罐糖都拿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I should have brought the whole jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件应该合身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, this should fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道琼是怎么回事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happened with Joan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她留下来 工作了一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she'd have stayed, worked for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能等康复了直接走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't she have just left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我没见到过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen it work like that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿工作多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多有1年吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟我老爸被人发现的时候 都是奄奄一息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad and I were both pretty messed up when they found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说只能救活一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that they could only save one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直被蒙在鼓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the longest time, I actually believed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今才明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸要高大 强壮许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was bigger, stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have fought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们造成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have been a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们是故意不救他的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left him behind on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩对这事睁一只眼闭一只眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Dawn just looked the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.03,0:13:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看似她在掌控全局 实则不然\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, she's in charge, but just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一旦时机成熟 我就要离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I'm out of here when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找我的叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came looking for my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再接老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get back to my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,里士满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗吉尼亚的首府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那儿有高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看我骨瘦如柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they think I'm scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我不堪一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实他们一点也不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they don't know shit about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了解我是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了解你是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏普德 你已经连值两班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shepherd, you've already pulled a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在换我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还没吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you didn't have breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是停战协议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace treaty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用吃很多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会受你逼迫留很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not staying any longer than you make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该把这看成坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you shouldn't see this as a sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你提供食物 衣服 保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you food, clothes, protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西从来都不是免费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When have those things ever been free?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没主动向你求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你确实需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着看看我们做的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to look at the good we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算很艰难 我们还是救了琼一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard as it was, we saved Joan's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了崔维特一命 我们还救了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevitt's life. We saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我维持着这里的运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm keeping all of us going here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not a small thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们付出了很多才变成今天这样 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's taken a lot to get us here, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我相信灾变之前的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe that what we had before all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,并未终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们最终得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we're finally rescued,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等噩梦结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this nightmare ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会需要重建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna need to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的认为有人会来救我们吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think someone's coming for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有像我们一样的人存在 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still people like us, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有试图维护世界 重建秩序的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People trying to keep the world alive, to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 我们都得贡献一份力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, we all have to contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都得妥协让步\N{\fnArial\fs30}To compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有得到 就要有回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we take, we give back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以继续回报你欠我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So keep working off what you owe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你很快就可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll be out of here in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 假如你想离开的话 - 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If that's what you want. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就得吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you have to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话 你会变得虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, you'll get weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能好起来 你会需要更多的治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't heal, you'll require more treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就不能工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you won't be able to do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你情非得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唱得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫爱德华兹医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Dr. Edwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以控制他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她没有 因为这样更简单一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she doesn't because it's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she's a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜当本人不用付出代价时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's easy to make a deal with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能轻易地和恶魔做交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you're not the one paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西不见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is yours, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.53,0:19:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,青苹果味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sour apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和道恩从儿科那里找来的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the kind Dawn acquired from pediatrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以尝一尝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose you could have a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.99,0:19:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能想起来这个味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if it rings any bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想确认一下我把这糖还对人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be sure I'm returning this to its rightful owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 很好 - 别烦她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. That's right. - Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这姑娘是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl should have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不是你的 戈尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's yours, Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:19:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你认为你能让琼回到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you think you're getting Joan back…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让她回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为道恩会阻止我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Dawn's gonna stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在替人出头吗 医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stepping up, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生病的时候会怎么样呢 戈尔曼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you get sick, Gorman?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤口什么时候感染的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get an infection?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你被咬时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得会有医生治疗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's gonna be somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你之外的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody who ain't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有人能顶替她掌管一切呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe somebody in charge who ain't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么留在这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随时可以走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could leave whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要留在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到格拉迪纪念医院的一层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the ground floor of Grady Memorial Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.89,0:21:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要带我来这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当我开始想太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I start thinking about it too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就下来看看这幅场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come down to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要带我来这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你问我为什么要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked why I stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你讲个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.32,0:22:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当灾变爆发的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When everything started,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩听命于一个叫汉森的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn reported to a guy named Hanson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被派来清空医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had orders to clear the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大家转移到巴特勒公园去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and move everyone to Butler Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多在午夜时 我们听到飞机声\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was close to midnight when we heard the jets,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸声\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭喊声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.02,0:22:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时正在三楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.35,0:22:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩和汉森的小队正在进行最后的搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn and Hanson's teams were doing a final sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.34,0:22:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we knew it was bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是来这里后 我们才知道到底有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just didn't know how bad till we came up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city had fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.97,0:22:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们疏散的所有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone we evacuated…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初我们几乎足不出户\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kept mostly to ourselves at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到食物吃光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}till the food ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始每次派一些人出去搜寻补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We started going out on runs, a few of us at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:22:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会看到需要帮助的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd see people who needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在苦苦支撑 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely holding on. But …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也自身难保\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were barely holding on ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来 我实在无法视而不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came a time I couldn't look away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.09,0:23:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的衣服被凝固汽油弹烧着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Napalm burns on his clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.98,0:23:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮肤被烧伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩说我们分不出资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn said we couldn't spare the resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们达成了一个协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we struck a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd use what I could to heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他必须通过劳动来回报我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd compensate us for those resources through service.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.49,0:23:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.33,0:23:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉森崩溃了 他做了几个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanson cracked. He made some calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死了几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩解决了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn took care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.71,0:23:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她干掉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.89,0:23:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带领我们经历艰险\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw us past it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.45,0:24:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们团结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.37,0:24:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证每个人都活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管这样的日子叫活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this living?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.42,0:24:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在呼吸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带来的那些病人 他们也还在呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patients we brought here, they're still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.20,0:24:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果在这些围墙外 孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside these walls, alone, unprotected,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.87,0:24:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们和我们都活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd be dead. We'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩在外面坚持不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not the ones who make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况虽然很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}As bad as it gets,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.46,0:24:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里至少比外面安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's still better than down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.63,0:24:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你顺便去看一下崔维特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you look in on Mr. Trevitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.89,0:24:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后今天就到此为止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他病情稳定 还要注射75毫克氯氮平\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stable, due for another 75mg of Clozapine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们从头来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tomorrow we'll start fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.24,0:24:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.62,0:25:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still at it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.41,0:25:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.15,0:25:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.24,0:25:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前他很稳定 直到你俩与他独处一室\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was fine until the two of you were alone with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:25:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.03,0:26:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我实话实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个意外 贝丝出去拿纱布\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident. Beth left to get some gauze.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在擦地 可能不小心拔掉了呼吸机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mopping. I must have unplugged the ventilator somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.12,0:26:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只停了一分钟而已 - 不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It only stopped for a minute. - But that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.95,0:26:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我又插上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.42,0:26:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带去我办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩 这只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn, it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.72,0:26:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.01,0:26:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他突然开始抽搐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just… he just started seizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.16,0:26:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽搐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他注射了氯硝安定 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you gave him Clonazepam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.49,0:26:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,氯 氯氮平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloz… Clozapine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.46,0:26:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是氯氮平\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Clozapine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是那样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.68,0:26:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 趁着崔维特先生的尸体还没冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, we need to deal with Mr. Trevitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.79,0:26:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把他处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.14,0:26:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,求了 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.29,0:26:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求了 - 我们阻止不了 你阻止不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! - We can't… you can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:26:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.97,0:27:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.37,0:27:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我最优秀的工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably my best worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他说的呼吸机的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that story he told about the ventilator?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.40,0:27:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子不太会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy's not much of a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.05,0:27:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你早就知道了 为什么你不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you knew, then why did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想那样做 但我必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to. I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个好人的无心之过差点把一切都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good man's mistakes almost ended everything for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,若让这样的事重演 那我就太该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll be damned if I'm gonna let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.05,0:27:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做出的牺牲都是为了大我的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every sacrifice we make needs to be for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.16,0:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦不是 一旦我们忽视了这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second it isn't, the second we lose sight of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.78,0:27:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 你并不属于大我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, you're not the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.03,0:27:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不够强壮 - 我很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not strong enough. - I am strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.55,0:27:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少人需要冒着生命危险来救你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people had to risk their lives to save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.25,0:27:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 你也是体制的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here, you are part of a system.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.83,0:28:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,受保护者们能让我的警官开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wards keep my officers happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.40,0:28:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的警官越是开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The happier my officers are,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.07,0:28:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就越会努力地帮助我们继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}the harder they work to keep us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.94,0:28:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this hasn't been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.99,0:28:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都做出了妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been compromises,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是确实管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.44,0:28:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们救了我们之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after they rescue us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.85,0:28:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能让世界重建秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna help put the world back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们一直在坚持着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're the ones holding on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们在这里做的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the good we're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.05,0:28:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你要做的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the good you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这才让你有所价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes you worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.94,0:28:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在外面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.68,0:28:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么死 要么成为别人的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except dead or somebody's burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.73,0:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡扯 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's bullshit. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.37,0:28:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来的那晚上我就看到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this the night you came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.41,0:28:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是胡扯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this bullshit, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.68,0:29:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人注定不能接受这种生活 但没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people just aren't meant for this life, and that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.70,0:29:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们不占那些能接受的人的便宜就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as they don't take advantage of the ones who are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看上去那么糟啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as bad as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.94,0:29:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有止痛药 基本不疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painkillers. It barely even hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.60,0:29:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩需要崔维特来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn needed Trevitt for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.25,0:29:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那就是原因所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that's what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.68,0:29:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwed-up thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.04,0:29:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's trapped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.66,0:29:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没被困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.30,0:29:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.93,0:29:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,从地下室出去最快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basement's the fastest way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:29:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但凡有一点动静 都会招来行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any noise and we got rotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.65,0:30:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就无声无息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we won't make noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.41,0:30:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以盯着道恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can keep an eye on Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.07,0:30:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她办公室里有一把电梯组的备用钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She keeps a spare key to the elevator banks somewhere in her office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.75,0:30:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.44,0:30:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望没有打扰到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not interrupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.28,0:32:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩要我拿她的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn was just asking for her key.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was she, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.93,0:32:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚跟道恩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I was just with Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不记得她说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't seem to remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.73,0:32:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不必让她知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she doesn't have to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's another solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.76,0:32:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你我双赢的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little win-win for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.68,0:33:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 贝丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how about it, Bethy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.57,0:33:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里解决好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna work something out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.35,0:33:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.14,0:33:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼 她就不太配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Joan, she's not such a team player.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.05,0:33:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我运气真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.78,0:33:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不怎么好斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.73,0:33:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只是电池的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it may just be the battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.42,0:33:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找个新的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stop in and grab another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.17,0:33:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.76,0:33:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.50,0:34:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Joan was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她和戈尔曼朝你办公室去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw her and Gorman headed towards your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全后 我爬下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're safe, I'll climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.81,0:34:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.61,0:36:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚？诺亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah? Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.70,0:36:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.49,0:36:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能 我没事 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I'm okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.35,0:37:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.13,0:39:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的以为自己是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.81,0:39:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他攻击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.23,0:39:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他攻击了琼一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like he attacked Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.20,0:39:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你放任他不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.31,0:39:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这里发生了什么 却放任不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's happening here and you let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.87,0:39:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你任凭这一切发生 - 这是为了坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're letting it happen. - So that we make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.94,0:39:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会来救我们 道恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's coming, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.25,0:39:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会死 而你白白任凭这一切发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna die and you let this happen for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.83,0:40:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愈合得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're healing quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.97,0:40:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几天就能继续工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be ready to jump back into it in a couple more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.03,0:40:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样应该就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that should about do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.15,0:40:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道崔维特是医生的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know Trevitt was a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.03,0:40:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才让我给他打错了药 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you had me give him the wrong meds, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你借我的手杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you had me kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.91,0:40:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果他活下来 就会多一个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if he had lived, there'd be another doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩就不需要你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dawn wouldn't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.98,0:40:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会再保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔维特是圣依纳爵医院的肿瘤学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevitt was an oncologist at St. Ignatius.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.05,0:40:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.17,0:40:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会赶走我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would have kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.86,0:40:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈尔曼也许会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Gorman…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.51,0:40:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe he would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.98,0:41:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.98,0:41:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用一切可以用的资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use everything you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.20,0:41:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们抓住耶稣时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they arrested Christ,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.10,0:41:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得否认自己是门徒之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter denied being one of his disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.68,0:41:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.28,0:41:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则他们也会把他钉在十字架上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would have crucified him, too.
